# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Model artifacts must be byte-faithful on checkout AND checkin:
# - LightGBM's model parser rejects CRLF: a fresh clone with core.autocrlf=true smudged
#   the LF .txt blobs to CRLF and every lgb.Booster(model_file=...) load aborted with
#   "Model format error, expect a tree here" (Task W3b clean-checkout audit, 2026-10-05).
# - *.joblib pickles contain stray 0x0D bytes and no NUL byte, so text=auto classified
#   them as text and the clean filter stripped CRs at checkin, corrupting the blob
#   relative to the working file.
ml/models/**/*.txt -text
ml/models/**/*.joblib -text
